  "image": {
    "src": "/images/scenes/weekend-plans.webp",
    "alt": "週五放學後的走廊旁，三位國中生正開心地聚在一起聊天規劃週末，男孩笑著指著河濱公園路線，女孩背著書包熱情回應，另一位同學則看著手錶確認時間，陽光灑滿整個畫面。",
    "width": 1536,
    "height": 1024
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "After class on Friday, Kevin asks Amy, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "What are you doing this ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "what-are-you-doing-this-weekend"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "weekend",
          "phraseIds": [
            "what-are-you-doing-this-weekend"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "weekend"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "what-are-you-doing-this-weekend"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "週五下課後，Kevin 問 Amy：「這個週末妳打算做什麼？」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Amy smiles and says that she has no special plans."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Amy 笑著說她沒有什麼特別的計畫。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“Ethan and I want to ride a "
        },
        {
          "text": "bicycle",
          "wordIds": [
            "bicycle"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " at the riverside "
        },
        {
          "text": "park",
          "wordIds": [
            "park"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ",” Kevin says."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "「Ethan 和我想在河濱公園騎腳踏車，」Kevin 說。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "He looks at Amy excitedly and asks, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "Do you want to go with us?",
          "phraseIds": [
            "do-you-want-to-go-with-us"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他興奮地看著 Amy 問道：「妳想和我們一起去嗎？」"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "“"
        },
        {
          "text": "Sounds like fun!",
          "phraseIds": [
            "sounds-like-fun"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "” Amy replies with a big smile."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "「聽起來很好玩！」Amy 帶著大大的笑容回答。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "They agree to "
        },
        {
          "text": "meet",
          "wordIds": [
            "meet"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " near the entrance, and Ethan checks the "
        },
        {
          "text": "time",
          "wordIds": [
            "time"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " on his phone."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "他們約好在入口附近碰面，Ethan 則用手機確認了時間。"
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Kevin waves happily to Amy and says, “"
        },
        {
          "text": "See you on ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "see-you-on-saturday"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saturday",
          "phraseIds": [
            "see-you-on-saturday"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "saturday"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "phraseIds": [
            "see-you-on-saturday"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "”"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Kevin 開心地向 Amy 揮手說：「週六見。」"
    }
  ],
